msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"(That kid's got some legs on him. He went down Pink Street, but which way "
"did he turn?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"That was the thief everyone's complaining about! Why didn't you chase after "
"him!? Go get my bag back from that jerk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Do I look like a hero to you? I mean, what if his goons come out? That'll "
"get dangerous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Hey. Did you see a kid running this way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"If you mean the bag snatcher, he took a left at the first 4-way intersection"
" down Pink Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "You can still catch him if you hurry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Right. He won't get away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"That bag snatcher took a left at the first 4-way intersection down Pink "
"Street. Better hurry if you wanna catch him!"
msgstr ""

